        "nl-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "5380295c-5d66-3660-97d4-458f848b9230",
                "word": "verstouten",
                "pos": "verb",
                "lang_code": "nl",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0c6c279f-b704-32b3-b1b1-c8e990201fa8",
                        "entry_id": "5380295c-5d66-3660-97d4-458f848b9230",
                        "glosses": [
                            "de moed opbrengen"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5a32788b-32ec-4143-9cc5-95b1c1b573e0",
                                "sense_id": "0c6c279f-b704-32b3-b1b1-c8e990201fa8",
                                "text": "Deze buitengewoon onduidelijke en verward geschreven dispositie - als we ons verstouten de instructies zonder het religieuze ontzag voor Napoleons genialiteit te beschouwen - bevatte vier punten, vier instructies."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "90aecd8b-5647-4374-a7bd-b0c87411e5cd",
                                "sense_id": "0c6c279f-b704-32b3-b1b1-c8e990201fa8",
                                "text": "Toch zijn er wel grenzen. Kritiek op de boodschap mag, moet zelfs helder zijn. Maar wie daarbij zich verstout om niet de boodschap maar de boodschapper aan te vallen, is per saldo de verliezer. Het politiek bedrijf kan alleen goed functioneren als de woordvoerders respectvol met elkaar omgaan. Dat lijkt Wilders soms te vergeten."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bc4478da-46be-4f52-af96-b1134852f493",
                        "source_entry_id": "5380295c-5d66-3660-97d4-458f848b9230",
                        "source_sense_id": "0c6c279f-b704-32b3-b1b1-c8e990201fa8",
                        "source_sense_description": "de moed opbrengen",
                        "target_lang_word": "embolden",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "embolden",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "20d9f87c-0f6b-3041-aa67-0cc895c753f8",
                                        "entry_id": "d8998bd0-0b9e-3074-a674-5a9c61690f64",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To render (someone) bolder or more courageous; to encourage, to hearten."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4fa3e6d6-78b2-4f4b-b876-61f3ba5d93da",
                                                "sense_id": "20d9f87c-0f6b-3041-aa67-0cc895c753f8",
                                                "text": "Steel your thoughts, ſharp your reſolue, imboldẽ your spirit, graſp your ſvvords; alarum miſchief, & vvith an vndãted brovv, out ſcout the grim oppoſition of most menacing perill."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "afce45be-bd77-4748-9485-87952c79cbeb",
                                                "sense_id": "20d9f87c-0f6b-3041-aa67-0cc895c753f8",
                                                "text": "I haue heard many ſuch things: miſerable comforters are ye all. Shall vaine words haue an ende? or what emboldeneth thee, that thou anſwereſt?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "323c31b3-0871-4b60-880e-234de9ce0e10",
                                                "sense_id": "20d9f87c-0f6b-3041-aa67-0cc895c753f8",
                                                "text": "I haue ſeene a pardon giuen to a man vpon the gallovves, but vvho ſo emboldeneth himſelfe thereuypon, perhaps the rope may be his hire: it is not good to put it vpon the Pſalme of Miſerere, and the neck-verſe, for ſometime he prooues no clarke."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "82bb6901-87b4-4565-9d5a-c01cf211e09a",
                                                "sense_id": "20d9f87c-0f6b-3041-aa67-0cc895c753f8",
                                                "text": "Their lookes imboldned, modeſtie novv gone, / Conuert at length to little-differing Stone."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "67b10266-6fe1-480f-803c-830ffcf6dd96",
                                                "sense_id": "20d9f87c-0f6b-3041-aa67-0cc895c753f8",
                                                "text": "Give me a reaſon; vvhat is it that ſtirrs thee to reply upon me, VVhat emboldeneth thee to anſvver? The Hebrevv vvord ſignifies, firſt, to ſtrengthen, to fortifie, or confirme; he that is ſtrengthened, is emboldened."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "797d58f9-3006-4557-bc20-8cddbbc7b47a",
                                                "sense_id": "20d9f87c-0f6b-3041-aa67-0cc895c753f8",
                                                "text": "Thus I embold'nd ſpake, and freedom us'd / Permiſſive, and acceptance found, which gain'd / This anſwer from the gratious voice Divine."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dac97193-2fed-411d-8b14-bfb42634260c",
                                                "sense_id": "20d9f87c-0f6b-3041-aa67-0cc895c753f8",
                                                "text": "[H]earing by chance of your worship's great humanity towards robin-red-breasts and tom-tits, he [a rooster] is emboldened to beseech you to take his deplorable condition into your tender consideration, who otherwise must suffer, with many thousands more as innocent as himself, that inhuman barbarity of a Shrove-Tuesday persecution."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e4d65784-0285-4ad1-ad4d-0d1b8f682f8f",
                                                "sense_id": "20d9f87c-0f6b-3041-aa67-0cc895c753f8",
                                                "text": "I have called myſelf to Account upon it, vvhether any Levity in my Looks, my Dreſs, my Appearance, could imbolden ſuch an affrontive Inſolence."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cd6243b9-fa9c-4a8b-a8f7-e5e2d7e922ce",
                                                "sense_id": "20d9f87c-0f6b-3041-aa67-0cc895c753f8",
                                                "text": "Nay, now, Luis, thou emboldenest me to remind thee that I expressed a wish that thou would'st not go on thy last voyage to the north, and yet thou didst depart!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "41603e0e-58db-4f8d-8262-6f681e1dc928",
                                                "sense_id": "20d9f87c-0f6b-3041-aa67-0cc895c753f8",
                                                "text": "In the day I called, Thou answeredst me; / Thou emboldenedst me with strength in my soul."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "28057250-e819-4cc2-924a-94a0c42569ec",
                                                "sense_id": "20d9f87c-0f6b-3041-aa67-0cc895c753f8",
                                                "text": "'Tis thou [champagne] who emboldenest by thy sunny influence and exhilarating smiles the feeble, the nervous, and the weak, who plantest courage in the hearts of the speechless, and bringest voice to the lips of the silent."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ef913755-b1e7-4216-a01a-2da9db7bc48c",
                                                "sense_id": "20d9f87c-0f6b-3041-aa67-0cc895c753f8",
                                                "text": "About this time, the success of the Liverpool & Manchester Railway had emboldened people to think that it was necessary merely to invest in any proposed new line to be assured of at least a 10 per cent. return on their money."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "838668f5-2c4e-40a9-bfdf-b0e8f4bcb10b",
                                                "sense_id": "20d9f87c-0f6b-3041-aa67-0cc895c753f8",
                                                "text": "The peasants did not automatically demand arms to defend a new-won plot of land. Nor was the key motivation simple fear of the landlord's revenge, as Sidney Rittenberg and other observers suggested at the time. Indeed, far from emboldening the peasant, that fear probably had more of an intimidating influence."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "46683bf3-bdd3-44f8-b692-18646dad48d1",
                                                "sense_id": "20d9f87c-0f6b-3041-aa67-0cc895c753f8",
                                                "text": "Broadly speaking, the official Chinese reaction has been to express concern and skepticism about the stated U.S. rationale for the rebalance to Asia, lament the \"lack of strategic trust\" between Washington and Beijing, urge greater respect for Chinese \"core interests,\" stress negative consequences of the rebalance for Asian security (especially in its supposed rose in emboldening U.S. allies and partners to challenge Chinese maritime territorial claims), and redouble efforts to stabilize Sino–U.S. relations, most notably through efforts to build a \"new type of great power relations\" with Washington."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dde1b9b4-1417-4979-8ac0-51ea040dc83f",
                                                "sense_id": "20d9f87c-0f6b-3041-aa67-0cc895c753f8",
                                                "text": "The best end state takes the most devotion. Such commitment emboldens the team, inspires individual members, and makes everything that follows worth doing. It takes courage to make such choices, and the exercise of that courage, in turn, further emboldens people."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "40c4d3f3-8b36-4c3b-9301-954eda77c15d",
                                                "sense_id": "20d9f87c-0f6b-3041-aa67-0cc895c753f8",
                                                "text": "The sense that money and technology can overcome nature has emboldened Americans. Where money and technology fail, though, it inevitably falls to government policies – and government subsidies – to pick up the slack."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0aceef2a-110f-3243-b195-d12482bbcd3e",
                                        "entry_id": "d8998bd0-0b9e-3074-a674-5a9c61690f64",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To format (text) in boldface."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "20d5cfee-901f-45d8-b0b1-c15165b5315c",
                                                "sense_id": "0aceef2a-110f-3243-b195-d12482bbcd3e",
                                                "text": "This note introduces several additional features of LATEX: […] ▪ The use of text style commands, including the \\emph command to emphasize text, the \\textbf command to embolden text, and the \\texttt command to produce typewriter style text."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "287d5ada-9548-4504-ac7a-52a42dea3e6a",
                                                "sense_id": "0aceef2a-110f-3243-b195-d12482bbcd3e",
                                                "text": "The [HTML] tags <p></p> indicate paragraphs breaks, and we have included some basic text formatting: <em></em> for emphasis (typically italics), <u></u> for underline and <strong></strong> to embolden text."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a12599e3-4016-44de-865f-ca231c71b5ad",
                                                "sense_id": "0aceef2a-110f-3243-b195-d12482bbcd3e",
                                                "text": "Embolden the company name. Balance-wise, the company name could do with standing out more."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
